// SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
//
// Placeholder dialogue for the Plume AI Sales Assistant widget. Structure
// mirrors the subject vendor's sales-assistant flow (greeting → demo →
// support); the copy is Plume-voice placeholder pending the owner-authored
// pass. The node titles GetADemo / Support are contract: the persistent
// chips jump to them, and the assistant session validates these titles
// against the compiled program's node table at startup
// (see src/lib/state/assistant.svelte.ts).
//
// Feature surface exercised on purpose — conditions, <<set>>/<<declare>>,
// <<once>>, <<jump>>, visited(), and {expr} interpolation — it is the
// scaffold's own smoke test.

title: Start
---
<<declare $demoRequested = false>>
<<declare $supportVisited = false>>
<<declare $sessionRef = random_range(10000, 99999)>>
<<if visited("Start")>>
	Assistant: Welcome back. Everything is already together.
<<else>>
	Assistant: Welcome to Plume.
	Assistant: I'm the Plume AI Sales Assistant.
<<endif>>
Assistant: What would you like to know? Your session reference is {$sessionRef}.
-> What is PlumeOS?
	Assistant: One map. Every camera, every alert, every agency — PlumeOS keeps it all already together.
	Assistant: Nothing to assemble. Nothing to reconcile.
	-> Get a Demo
		<<jump GetADemo>>
	-> Something else
		Assistant: Of course.
		<<jump Start>>
-> About my demo <<if $demoRequested>>
	Assistant: Your demonstration is scheduled — reference {$sessionRef}.
	Assistant: A Plume representative will arrive shortly.
	-> Something else
		<<jump Start>>
	-> That's all
		<<jump Wrapup>>
-> Get a Demo
	<<jump GetADemo>>
-> Support
	<<jump Support>>
===

title: GetADemo
---
<<set $demoRequested to true>>
Assistant: A demonstration. Of course.
Assistant: A Plume representative will configure a live PlumeOS environment for your jurisdiction — sample data included, your consent already on file.
-> Book it
	Assistant: Consider it booked. Your reference is {$sessionRef}.
	-> Something else
		<<jump Start>>
	-> That's all
		<<jump Wrapup>>
-> Maybe later
	Assistant: Later is also noted.
	-> Something else
		<<jump Start>>
	-> That's all
		<<jump Wrapup>>
===

title: Support
---
<<set $supportVisited to true>>
Assistant: Support. The Plume care team is reachable through the following channels:
Assistant: By phone: 1-800-PLUME-01.
Assistant: By email: care@plume.example.
Assistant: This conversation is retained for quality and assurance purposes.
-> Something else
	<<jump Start>>
-> That's all
	<<jump Wrapup>>
===

title: Wrapup
---
Assistant: Thank you for your interest in Plume. It has already been recorded.
===
